An analysis of 130 GeV Au+Au data in Ref. [57] inspired the following fit model. That paper presents two-particle correlations on transverse momentum variable \(X(p_{t})\equiv 1-\exp\{-(m_{t}-m_{0})/0.4\) GeV\(\}\) and compared it to theoretical predictions. The extent to which pQCD could match the data was tested with events generated from HIJING. HIJING matched the high momentum region of the data but failed to predict the lower momentum region,

