**Vita**

Elizabeth Wingfield Oldag was born in Manhattan, Kansas, the daughter of William Wingfield and Kristin Cunningham. She graduated from Sarasota High School in Sarasota, Florida in 2003. She then attended Florida State University in Tallahassee, Florida where she graduated with a Bachelor of Science in physics in 2007. In the fall of 2007 she entered the physics graduate program at the University of Texas at Austin and advanced to doctoral candidacy in August of 2009.

